# Upstream's battery and start menu widgets run python3 scripts.
Suggests: python3
Description: taskbar, dock and panel for Wayland stacking compositors
 SFWBar is a GTK 3 layer-shell panel for Wayland compositors with a
 stacking layout, such as labwc. It has a taskbar with pinned apps and
 grouped windows, a pager, tray, window switcher and a scripting
 language for custom widgets. A bar can auto-hide and show again when
 the pointer touches the screen edge.
 .
 This is upstream sfwbar, packaged for FlickOS, which uses it as the
 dock of the Cupertino desktop layout. The pulse, pipewire, alsa and
 xkbmap modules are not built.
